+## 6. What this page does not do
+
+It does not construct the continuum limit of the correlation functions as the cutoff is removed, nor prove Euclidean invariance
+of the limit (the ultraviolet half's own open piece), and it does not touch the crossover from the weak-coupling regime to the
+strong-coupling disk, where the four-dimensional mass gap's open mathematics lies. It reduces the one unpublished theorem of the
+ultraviolet half to the leading-term identification of (B1) and to Theorem 1's own inductive bounds.
